      "description": "Main directory link, also repeated in the closing invitation.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-primary\" href=\"/builders\">Find your people <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:22px;padding:16px 23px;min-height:55px;border-radius:8px;background:#264be6;color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.6;text-decoration:none;transition:background 160ms,transform 200ms}.ds-primary:hover{background:#1738ba;transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-primary:active{transform:translateY(0)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #264be6;outline-offset:5px;}@media(max-width:1150px){.ds-primary{padding:14px 18px;gap:14px}}@media(max-width:540px){.ds-primary{font-size:12px;padding:13px 15px;min-height:48px;gap:12px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary{transition:none}}"
